  "schematicNotes": [
    {
      "id": "n_cavity_notes",
      "text": "CAVITY NOTES - full text of the signals marked * on this drawing\nEFI Main Relay 85: ACTIVE-LOW Coil - -> Aux 6 / A28 - low-side (Aux 5-8 capable of either; low-side chosen for ECU Hold Power)\nEFI Main Relay 86: Coil + - PERMANENT battery via F12 5A (must stay live after key-off for Hold Power)\nETB Power Relay 85: ACTIVE-LOW Coil - -> Aux 2 / A20 - LOW-SIDE ONLY (Aux 1-4)\nETB Power Relay 86: Coil + - ignition-switched 12V (EFI main relay 87)\nFuel Pump Relay 85: ACTIVE-LOW Coil - -> Aux 3 / A19 - LOW-SIDE ONLY (Aux 1-4)\nFuel Pump Relay 86: Coil + - ignition-switched 12V (EFI main relay 87)\nRadiator Fan Relay (on/off) 86: Coil + - ignition-switched 12V (EFI main relay 87)\nCondenser Fan Relay (on/off, diode) 85: ACTIVE-LOW Coil - -> Ign 5 / B13 - low-side, NO internal flywheel diode - diode-suppressed relay fitted (TE 7-1904094-9)\nCondenser Fan Relay (on/off, diode) 86: Coil + - ignition-switched 12V (EFI main relay 87)\nStart Relay 86: Coil + - ignition-switched 12V (EFI main relay 87)\ncsb3io (label): ECUMaster CSB3 (power feed — full I/O on ST185-A-ECU)\nBulkhead A - firewall (HDP24-2 1: spare (size 16) - was the shared shield drain, retired by 6.32\nBulkhead B - firewall (HDP24-2 1: Switched 12V - INJECTOR power feed (size 12, 25A)\nBulkhead B - firewall (HDP24-2 2: Switched 12V - COP / ignition coil power feed (size 12, 25A)\nBulkhead B - firewall (HDP24-2 14: MRS EPS pump logic enable (F13 7.5A, ignition-switched)\nCabin fuse block (passenger gl F12: 5A - relay coil feed, PERMANENT (EFI main relay 86)\nCabin fuse block (passenger gl F13: 7.5A - MRS EPS pump logic enable (ignition-switched)\nHigh-current fuse block HCFB H4: 60A AMI - EPS pump relay 30 (wire drawn on ST185-EngineRoom-C from dm_hcfb_h4)",
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 3360,
        "y": 0
      }
    }
  ],
